TorrentNG Launchpad PPA package
===============================

The service starts after installation and listens on 127.0.0.1:8080. Open
http://127.0.0.1:8080/ locally. The package deliberately keeps the API on
loopback and uses an empty token list only for that loopback-only default.

Before exposing TorrentNG through a non-loopback bind or reverse proxy, add a
real API token to /etc/torrentngd/config.toml. Public binds reject missing or
placeholder tokens. Restart the service after changing configuration:

    sudo systemctl restart torrentngd

Persistent state and the default download directory live under
/var/lib/torrentngd. The service runs as the unprivileged torrentngd account.

The PPA contains packages for Ubuntu Jammy, Noble, and Resolute on amd64 and
arm64. Report package issues at https://github.com/snapetech/TorrentNG/issues.
